                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16537943" author="klaster_1" created="Tue, 10 Jul 2018 03:35:12 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;The issue is caused by content security policy violation, no idea why this didn&apos;t happen before. To fix it, change webpack dev server headers to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-javascript&quot;&gt;
headers: {
 &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;Content-Security-Policy&apos;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;`worker-src &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;self&apos;&lt;/span&gt; blob:; script-src &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;self&apos;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;unsafe-inline&apos;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;unsafe-eval&apos;&lt;/span&gt; data: http: https:`&lt;/span&gt;
 },&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=vsisko&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;vsisko&quot;&gt;vsisko&lt;/a&gt; please check that the same doesn&apos;t happen when wev console is served by nginx (i.e. from docker).&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16538165" author="vsisko" created="Tue, 10 Jul 2018 07:27:38 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;After update of headers exception is not reproduced. &lt;br/&gt;
 Not reproduced in docker image.&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=alexdel&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;alexdel&quot;&gt;alexdel&lt;/a&gt; Please test fix in branch&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16541287" author="alexdel" created="Thu, 12 Jul 2018 08:04:48 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;After headers deletion in web pack config problem dissapeared. Fixed in branch ignite-8962,&#160;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=kuaw26&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;kuaw26&quot;&gt;kuaw26&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16541318" author="kuaw26" created="Thu, 12 Jul 2018 08:35:15 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Merged to master.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
